    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="6506d5cf-13ee-5903-8820-d822aeff469b" activityNameId="bae8cad1-370c-5f09-8f88-b9c67c9a5be2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Substation, land-based, 740MW offshore wind farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Substation, land-based, 740MW offshore wind farm
UUID=a40f748b-4944-36b1-86d1-01351531ba84
Land-based substation of a 740 MW offshore wind farm. Included processes: manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on the IEA Wind 740-10 MW Reference Offshore Wind Plant, derived in the IEA Wind Task 55, consisting of 74 wind turbines with a nominal capacity of 10 MW (Kainz, Quick, et al., 2024).

Main data source: 
Kainz, S. (2025). Life Cycle Inventory of the IEA Wind 740-10-MW Reference Offshore Wind Plant with irregular layout [Dataset]. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/ZENODO.15880601
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a40f748b-4944-36b1-86d1-01351531ba84.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
